message: "Please cite this software version when reporting calculations made with Curvature Studio."
title: "Curvature Studio"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Fujita"
    given-names: "Daishi"
    email: "dfujita@icems.kyoto-u.ac.jp"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FujitaG/curvature-studio"
url: "https://studio.curvature.workers.dev"
version: "0.5.11"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Browser application for editing and comparing finite, undirected, unit-weight
  graphs, computing effective and Ollivier-Ricci curvature, and exporting results
  and figures. Includes independent mathematical references and browser tests.
keywords:
  - graph curvature
  - effective curvature
  - Ollivier-Ricci curvature
  - research software
